<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>한규서 스마트폰 엿보기</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; }
        body { background: #0d0e15; color: #fff; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-height: 100vh; padding: 20px; }
        .phone { width: 340px; height: 680px; background: #1c1c1e; border-radius: 40px; border: 4px solid #3a3a3c; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
        .notch { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 110px; height: 24px; background: #000; border-radius: 0 0 14px 14px; z-index: 10; }
        .status { padding: 8px 20px; font-size: 11px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
        .screen { flex: 1; display: none; flex-direction: column; padding: 20px; overflow-y: auto; }
        .screen.active { display: flex; }
        #lock { text-align: center; justify-content: space-between; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2c3e50, #000); }
        .clock { font-size: 48px; font-weight: 200; margin-top: 40px; }
        .card { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); padding: 12px; border-radius: 14px; text-align: left; margin-top: 20px; cursor: pointer; }
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 15px; margin-top: 30px; }
        .icon { background: #333; height: 70px; border-radius: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 24px; cursor: pointer; }
        .icon span { font-size: 11px; margin-top: 4px; }
        .chat { background: #fee500; color: #000; padding: 10px; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 13px; max-width: 80%; }
        .btn-sound { background: #ff3b30; color: #fff; border: none; padding: 10px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; width: 100%; margin-top: 15px; cursor: pointer; }
        .home-btn { height: 20px; background: #1c1c1e; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; cursor: pointer; }
        .home-bar { width: 100px; height: 4px; background: #fff; border-radius: 2px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="phone">
        <div class="notch"></div>
        <div class="status"><span>09:10</span><span>LTE 80%</span></div>
        
        <!-- 잠금화면 -->
        <div class="screen active" id="lock" onclick="goScreen('home')">
            <div>
                <div class="clock">09:10</div>
                <div style="font-size:14px; opacity:0.8;">9월 10일 월요일</div>
                <div class="card" onclick="event.stopPropagation(); goScreen('kakao')">
                    <div style="font-size:10px; opacity:0.7;">카카오톡 • 방금 전</div>
                    <div style="font-weight:bold; margin-top:2px;">친엄마</div>
                    <div style="font-size:12px;">규서야... 엄마가 학교 앞에 선물 두고 갔다.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:12px; opacity:0.6; margin-bottom:20px;">터치하여 잠금 해제</div>
        </div>

        <!-- 홈화면 -->
        <div class="screen" id="home">
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="icon" onclick="goScreen('kakao')" style="background:#fee500;">💬<span style="color:#000;">카카오톡</span></div>
                <div class="icon" onclick="goScreen('memo')" style="background:#f8d64e;">📝<span style="color:#fff;">메모장</span></div>
                <div class="icon" onclick="goScreen('gallery')" style="background:#e1306c;">🖼️<span style="color:#fff;">갤러리</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 카카오톡 -->
        <div class="screen" id="kakao">
            <h3 style="margin-bottom:15px;">💬 친엄마</h3>
            <div class="chat">규서야... 엄마가 미안해. 학교 앞에 선물 두고 갔어.</div>
            <div class="chat" style="background:#fff; margin-left:auto;">찾아오지 마세요. 이런 거 필요 없어요.</div>
            <button class="btn-sound" onclick="alert('👠 (또각... 또각... 굽 소리가 귓가에 맴돌며 규서의 호흡이 가빠집니다.)')">👠 트라우마 소리 재생</button>
        </div>

        <!-- 메모장 -->
        <div class="screen" id="memo">
            <h3 style="margin-bottom:15px;">📝 비밀 메모</h3>
            <div style="background:#2c2c2e; padding:12px; border-radius:10px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.5;">
                <strong>또 그 구두 소리</strong><br>
                오늘 길에서 또각또각 소리가 들렸다. 세 살 때 날 버리고 가던 날 들렸던 그 구두 발자국 소리...
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 갤러리 -->
        <div class="screen" id="gallery">
            <h3 style="margin-bottom:15px;">🖼️ 추억 앨범</h3>
            <p style="font-size:13px; color:#aaa;">저장된 사진이 없습니다.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="home-btn" onclick="goScreen('home')"><div class="home-bar"></div></div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function goScreen(id) {
            document.querySelectorAll('.screen').forEach(s => s.classList.remove('active'));
            document.getElementById(id).classList.add('active');
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
